<title>UK: BT unavailable to comment on MCI talk.</title>
<headline>BT unavailable to comment on MCI talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc (BT) was not immediately available here to comment on a U.S. television report that the company is in talks to buy the remaining 80 percent of MCI Communications Corp, which it does not already own.</p>
</text>
